---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = "August 24, 2026";
---

<Layout 
  title="Review Standards & Link Disclosure - Toby on Fitness Tech"
  description="How TobyOnFitnessTech handles recommendations, manufacturer links, commissions, and editorial independence."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-neutral-800">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Review Standards & Link Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-lg p-6 mb-10">
      <p class="text-blue-200 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">The short version:</p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300">
        Amazon Associates is not active on this site. Amazon Music links are podcast listening destinations, not shopping affiliate links. A clearly labeled Speediance manufacturer link may pay me a commission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-300">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">FTC Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Some links on this website may be tracked affiliate links. Every monetized link is labeled beside the link before you click it. If you use one and make a purchase, I may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. The current tracked manufacturer link is to Speediance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Amazon</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          This site does not participate in Amazon Associates. Amazon links on the site do not carry an Associates tracking tag and do not pay me a commission. Amazon Music links simply open podcast episodes on that service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Recommendations come from my own use, logged training data, and the limitations I encounter. Purchase links do not change a verdict. Reviews keep the drawbacks, software regressions, replacement decisions, and products I cannot recommend.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          When I buy a product myself, I say so. If a product is provided, loaned, discounted, or tied to paid work, that relationship will be stated on the relevant page. Recommendations can change as the product, price, support, or my experience changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Questions</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Questions about a recommendation or link? Email <a href="mailto:admin@tobyonfitnesstech.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300">admin@tobyonfitnesstech.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
